  InputLines:
    - "// @input bool flexLayoutResize {\"hint\":\"Corner-grab resize behavior. <br><br><b>ON — flex layout:</b> web-style resize. Grabbing a corner changes the frame's inner area per axis; content keeps its 1× scale and the layout reflows to the new size, cropping overflow where a mask exists — like resizing a browser window. <br><br><b>OFF — scaling:</b> grabbing a corner uniformly scales the frame and everything inside it, preserving proportions — like zooming an image.\"}"
